# An empty library points at the directory; Browse lists the bundled feeds.
wait-for Feeds
expect No feeds yet
expect-missing ready offline
clean
shot rss-empty
tap Add a feed
wait-for Import OPML
clean
shot rss-add
tap Browse
wait-for Browse feeds
expect NASA Science
expect whole articles
expect-missing BBC
clean
shot rss-browse
# Following a starter opens its articles; back on the shelf, the feed is
# saved and the shelf says what is ready offline, with Refresh all beside it.
tap NASA Science
wait-for Select to add
tap NASA Science
wait-for unread of
clean
shot rss-articles
tap Back
wait-for Ready offline
expect Refresh all
clean
shot rss-shelf-offline
